pro rider: Mark McMorris
laminate: Triax fiberglass (versatile flex and consistent response)
core: Super Fly II 700G Core with Dualzone EGD and Squeezebox (stronger and lighter woods in specific areas for more pop and strength while reducing weight)
core zones: Dualzone EGD (wood grain along heel and toe edge in two unbroken zones perpendicular to rest of core for consistent edge hold and strength)
core sections: Squeezebox (thicker more powerful sections combined with thinner more flexible sections profiled throughout core for enhanced energy transfer, snappier and more stable)
edges: Frostbite Edges (edges extend out slightly underneath bindings for enhanced edge hold on hardpack and ice)
base: Sintered (durable, highly porous, added strength and wax absorption for long lasting glide)
factory break-in: Infinite Ride (overbuilt in factory then broken down by machinery so board rides the same from day one to day 100)
tip/tail construction: Pro-Tip (tip and tail taper out at points, reducing swing weight and promoting mobility)
resin: Super Sap Epoxy (bio-based resin, reduces carbon footprint by 50% over conventional petroleum-based epoxies)
terrain: All Mountain, Freestyle
riding style: Freestyle progression, park, all-mountain
shipping restriction: Australia only
